<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44580" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Sŏdŏma</span></b> ,
		ōrum, n., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σόδομα</span> (Heb. ), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>the city of Sodom in Palestine</i>,
					<i><span class="en">Tert. Apol. 40</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Vulg. Gen.
				14, 2</span></i>.—Called also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Sŏdŏma</span></b> ,
			ae, f., <i><span class="en">Sulp. Sev.
				Hist. Sacr. 1, 6</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Sedul. 1,
			105</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Vulg. Gen. 10, 19</span></i>; also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Sŏdŏmum</span></b> ,
				i, n., <i><span class="en">Sol.
			35</span></i>; and <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Sŏdŏmi</span></b> ,
			ōrum, m.,
				<i><span class="en">Tert. Carm. Sodom. 127</span></i> and 163.
			—Hence, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Sŏdŏmītae</span></b> ,
				ārum, m., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σοδομῖται</span>, <i>the
				inhabitants of Sodom</i>, <i>the Sodomites</i>,
					<i><span class="en">Prud. Apoth. 384</span></i>.—In
			the sing., adject.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Sodomita libido,</span>”
				<i>of Sodom</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Prud. Psych. 42</span></i>
			; so, cinis, id. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στεφ</span>. 5,
			195.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Sŏdŏmītĭcus</span></b> ,
				a, um, adj., <i>of</i>
			or <i>belonging to Sodom</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">peccatum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Hier. in Ezech. 5, 16, 49</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Alcim. 3, 51</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
